WEBVTT

00:15.952 --> 00:17.010
Captain.

00:18.188 --> 00:19.155
Captain.

00:20.423 --> 00:21.390
Captain!

00:22.425 --> 00:23.093
We have a problem!

00:23.093 --> 00:23.727
We have a problem!

00:25.195 --> 00:25.991
Sorry, sir!

00:27.130 --> 00:28.532
Just look at this!

00:28.532 --> 00:30.534
My sweater will be finished pretty soon...

00:30.534 --> 00:32.035
Forget the sweater; it doesn't matter!

00:32.035 --> 00:33.170
Shut up!

00:33.170 --> 00:35.438
Are you trying to say
my sweater doesn't matter?!

00:35.438 --> 00:36.405
More importantly...

00:36.540 --> 00:36.606
Apologize first! Apologize for that invective!

00:36.606 --> 00:39.743
Apologize first! Apologize for that invective!

00:39.743 --> 00:41.011
Why?

00:41.011 --> 00:42.546
Grr... You bastard!

00:42.546 --> 00:44.714
I'm gonna tell Miss Miyamoto on you!

00:44.714 --> 00:46.449
Will you just look at this, please?

00:46.449 --> 00:47.651
What's this?

00:47.651 --> 00:49.052
It's a communication from our home planet.

00:49.052 --> 00:52.283
You idiot, you should've told me
about that sooner! Take that!

00:52.722 --> 00:55.384
Uh-huh, uh-huh... Wh-What?!

00:55.759 --> 00:57.961
Do you finally understand the situation, sir?

00:57.961 --> 01:00.794
Paniponi Dash! has only four
more episodes to go?!

01:03.667 --> 01:05.969
You know that's not what it says!

01:06.803 --> 01:12.742
Lalalalala lalalala lalalala

01:13.443 --> 01:20.008
Lalalalala lalalala lalala la la la la

01:26.289 --> 01:29.559
I do have a dress for the party

01:29.559 --> 01:32.896
But I looked out of place at the park

01:32.896 --> 01:36.166
I pronounce it correctly

01:36.166 --> 01:39.269
"Karatto" should be "carat"

01:39.269 --> 01:42.439
I'm right here

01:42.439 --> 01:45.308
I see myself in the mirror

01:45.308 --> 01:48.879
An idol with slight makeup

01:48.879 --> 01:52.315
That's Girl Q

01:52.315 --> 01:53.908
Girl Q

01:56.453 --> 02:00.590
To the mysterious girl, everyone is like

02:00.590 --> 02:03.093
(Love ya, love ya, ya ya ya ya ya)

02:03.093 --> 02:07.197
With stimulating gaze

02:07.197 --> 02:09.699
(Love ya, love ya, ya ya ya ya ya)

02:09.699 --> 02:13.003
Someone please make me cry

02:13.003 --> 02:14.170
Someone please make me cry

02:16.306 --> 02:19.643
Someone please make me cry

02:19.643 --> 02:20.810
Someone please make me cry

02:40.063 --> 02:41.731
Morning!

02:42.399 --> 02:44.197
...is what it is, everyone.

02:45.101 --> 02:47.103
Okay, homeroom's over.

02:47.103 --> 02:47.370
Okay, homeroom's over.

02:49.039 --> 02:51.641
My, my. You have a cold, Becky?

02:51.641 --> 02:51.942
My, my. You have a cold, Becky?

02:51.942 --> 02:54.707
No, I don't think it's a cold...

02:55.745 --> 02:58.908
The weather did start getting
colder all of a sudden.

02:59.082 --> 03:02.518
Okay Becky! I'll warm you up,
since I'm always hot!

03:03.687 --> 03:04.988
Maho!

03:04.988 --> 03:06.489
Becky, you're so small!

03:06.489 --> 03:10.727
And suddenly you have long white ears, too!

03:10.727 --> 03:12.462
I think you're lovely!

03:12.462 --> 03:13.797
Your idiocy is the real thing.

03:16.499 --> 03:18.601
Yeah, it's definitely chilly.

03:18.601 --> 03:21.137
You guys take care to prevent colds too.

03:21.137 --> 03:21.204
I added a blanket to my bedding last night.

03:21.204 --> 03:23.707
I added a blanket to my bedding last night.

03:23.707 --> 03:24.841
Ditto what Forehead said.

03:24.841 --> 03:26.109
Don't call me "Forehead"!

03:27.544 --> 03:30.447
And I added an extra comforter.

03:30.447 --> 03:33.576
Ah, maybe I'll start using an
extra comforter tonight.

03:34.284 --> 03:37.454
What, Ichijo? Did you add two?

03:37.454 --> 03:38.855
I wish for world peace.

03:38.855 --> 03:40.550
Uh-huh, sure.

03:41.992 --> 03:44.728
So Becky, that said...

03:44.728 --> 03:46.093
Hmm?

03:48.565 --> 03:50.266
I'm cold, I'm cold, I'm cold...

03:50.266 --> 03:50.533
I'm cold, I'm cold, I'm cold...

03:50.533 --> 03:51.434
Kurumi?

03:51.434 --> 03:53.069
Hey, are you okay?

03:53.069 --> 03:54.437
Do you have a fever?

03:54.437 --> 03:54.460
Do you have a fever?

03:54.871 --> 03:56.206
Nope, no fever.

03:56.206 --> 03:56.539
Nope, no fever.

03:56.539 --> 03:58.441
