03:58.441 --> 04:01.077
I totally can't deal with the cold.

04:01.077 --> 04:04.848
"Totally can't deal"? I've never seen
anyone THIS bad before!

04:04.848 --> 04:06.782
You're the can't deal of the year!

04:08.084 --> 04:09.419
You're not Becky!

04:09.419 --> 04:12.514
Well, leaving aside the girl who's just noticed...

04:13.023 --> 04:16.526
Blech... Can I stay home from
school starting tomorrow?

04:16.526 --> 04:16.726
Blech... Can I stay home from
school starting tomorrow?

04:16.726 --> 04:19.462
What are you talking about? Of course not!

04:19.462 --> 04:21.031
But...

04:21.031 --> 04:23.833
You're not the only one who's cold! Tough it out.

04:23.833 --> 04:25.802
I can't tough it out!

04:25.802 --> 04:26.030
I can't tough it out!

04:26.936 --> 04:28.038
Oh, I know!

04:28.605 --> 04:32.275
Hey, you're a genius, so give me an item
that'll shield me from the cold.

04:32.275 --> 04:34.244
Bekiemon!

04:34.244 --> 04:35.512
I'll hit you, you know!

04:35.678 --> 04:38.848
Please! I'm so cold I'm gonna die!

04:38.848 --> 04:39.282
Please! I'm so cold I'm gonna die!

04:39.282 --> 04:40.750
I'll die! I'll die...

04:41.351 --> 04:42.841
You really have an item?

04:43.987 --> 04:44.621
Here.

04:44.621 --> 04:44.988
Here.

04:45.622 --> 04:46.790
What's this?

04:46.790 --> 04:48.191
It's a Toasty-Warm Pocket Warmer.

04:48.191 --> 04:49.159
And?

04:49.159 --> 04:50.760
You tap it like this.

04:50.994 --> 04:52.695
Good for you, Kurumi.

04:52.695 --> 04:54.230
Now you won't be cold.

04:57.500 --> 04:58.868
